#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:47
#: 57f9897976eb4fb1a3b60b6c6ae2e427
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:48
#: 776b759b17eb4114b69d2731ece1355e
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the RX2 (UART2_RX) pin. It supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. See :ref:`Radio Control Systems <common-rc-systems>` "
"for details for a specific RC system. "
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` is set to “23”, by default, to "
"enable this."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 RX2（UART2_RX）引脚上。支持除 PPM 以外的所有 RC 协议。特定 RC 系统的详情请参见 :ref:`Radio "
"Control Systems <common-rc-"
"systems>`。:ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为「23」以启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:50
#: 7036683fa7924879ae62e9f2d97a9db5
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX2 pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 RX2 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:51
#: 63890b3a15894d64aad31ee5206d36c7
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX2 and :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>`"
" be set to “7”."
msgstr "FPort 需要连接到 TX2 并将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设为「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:52
#: d186c8b223ae442384000aa9f3e612a6
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX2 connection, in addition to R2, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>`"
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除 R2 外还需要 TX2 连接，并自动提供数传。设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:53
#: 6d9705487fec4f51b821edf16b7d2c92
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connecton to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry. Set "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to “4”. =3."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 TX2 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设为「4」。=3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:56
#: 1115e0e33614482089f6dae69344056e
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:57
#: 356f2160d1344b91abf12349b9610fe9
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using the Tx pin of any UART excluding "
"SERIAL3(UART3). To enable support for FrSky S.PORT (the example shows "
"SERIAL6), you need to set the following parameters."
msgstr ""
"FrSky 数传使用除 SERIAL3（UART3）以外的任何 UART 的 Tx 引脚支持。要启用对 FrSky S.PORT 的支持（示例使用 "
"SERIAL6），需要设置以下参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:59
#: b094070efbe64b7a998d063f96f360ec
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:60
#: b61ca105af9e4412b026f2a8657b9702
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` = 7"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` = 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:63
#: a62ac9e308a149179ec5111366dc5a6d
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:64
#: 7d0f164b4c114627a4eafeedfc9670a9
msgid ""
"The TAKER H743 BT supports analog OSD using its internal OSD chip and "
"simultaneously HD goggle DisplayPort OSDs via the HD VTX connector."
msgstr ""
"TAKER H743 BT 通过其内部 OSD 芯片支持模拟 OSD，同时通过 HD VTX 连接器支持 HD 护目镜 DisplayPort OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:67
#: 79f915e9ddf6474c8f3d61edb2a82e4f
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr "VTX 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:68
#: fee69675b71a42f08478e701783ba7f8
msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a standard DJI HD VTX connection. Pin 1 of "
"the connector is 12v (or VBAT selected by solder pad selection) so be "
"careful not to connect to devices expecting 5v."
msgstr ""
"SH1.0-6P 连接器支持标准 DJI HD VTX 连接。连接器的第 1 引脚为 12V（或通过焊盘选择的 VBAT），请注意不要连接到期望 5V "
"的设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:71
#: 4ec94f1d88ee4d92b50c1f148a667d0d
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:72
#: 14e1c615586f4136be027b18e5bd0148
msgid ""
"The TAKER H743 BT supports up to 9 PWM/DShot outputs. The pads for motor "
"output M1 to M4 are on the esc connector, M5-M8 are solder pads, plus M9 is "
"defaulted for serial LED strip or can be used as another PWM output."
msgstr ""
"TAKER H743 BT 支持最多 9 路 PWM/DShot 输出。电机输出 M1 至 M4 的焊盘在 ESC 连接器上，M5-M8 是焊盘，M9 "
"默认用于串行 LED 灯带或可用作另一路 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:74
#: a842196f3e424572ad088e29062d078d
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:76
#: 660ac2777088491aa9c022fc83e075a7
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:77
#: 824b5293bef3487daa67ef1a077695ff
msgid "PWM 5-6 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5-6 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:78
#: 97e2dea1e65d4d44bcf764c214eab1cf
msgid "PWM 7-8 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7-8 在第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:79
#: 98cbeba87eeb47f983a962226e008947
msgid "PWM 9 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 9 在第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:81
#: 73c96c7f083c4a059ddc9a30b7de3186
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-8 support Bi-Directional DShot."
msgstr ""
"同组内的通道需要使用相同的输出速率。如果组内任何通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。通道 1-8 支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:86
#: 23472e4ab98742738b449f6b76512021
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:87
#: 2bb8a6983b134ec79f59eace97151640
msgid ""
"The board has a internal voltage sensor and connections on the ESC connector"
" for an external current sensor input. The voltage sensor can handle up to "
"6S. LiPo batteries."
msgstr "飞控板有内部电压传感器，并在 ESC 连接器上有外部电流传感器输入的连接。电压传感器可处理高达 6S 的锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:91
#: 74dc9ff0819d40ae914c927e4a4113b3
msgid "The default battery parameters are:"
msgstr "默认电池参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:93
#: faf1dd35216d4cec9442b1d0ac2b2eca
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:94
#: 8c9b03f2e7d14162b467c974e27100b0
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:95
#: f8b0a79b5ceb4a938bbb29a5a626ebef
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.1"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:96
#: a0f96cb7fade41358ae0d8f33b4b2833
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:97
#: 7ad786de45dc4ec087e4adfe669c8e42
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 28.5"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 28.5"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:100
#: 02a74eef59c8487d82e98b689b1d316f
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:101
#: 0dfa32bdf8d04fb99af9f8812685a5f3
msgid ""
"The TAKER H743 BT does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "TAKER H743 BT 没有内置罗盘，但可以通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:104
#: e533b66f02d647d1b2510d57027818f4
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:105
#: 80e83c8d4e6a422f820bb77df1521dea
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件可以通过按住引导程序按钮插入 USB 的 DFU 方式加载。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geprc-taker-h743-bt.rst:109
#: ab90cc9a1c7240ac92c52a5517bca8ab
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载后，可以使用任何 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
